WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
- Stupid, stupid shirt.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:04.786
Look at this hair. Oh my God.

00:00:04.786 --> 00:00:06.976
I mean, to be honest, this
is a pretty cool shirt,

00:00:06.976 --> 00:00:08.274
except it's a Trump shirt.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.265
(energetic orchestral music)

00:00:13.214 --> 00:00:14.731
- My name is Ryan and
I'm a Trump supporter.

00:00:14.731 --> 00:00:17.627
- My name is Ali and I
support Hillary Clinton.

00:00:17.627 --> 00:00:19.860
- My foremost agreement with Donald Trump

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.400
is his economic policies.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.015
- I side with Hillary Clinton because

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:24.970
I'm in line with a lot
of the things that she

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.009
has spent her life fighting for,

00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:28.993
health care, gun control,
reproductive rights.

00:00:28.993 --> 00:00:30.328
- When I find out who people support,

00:00:30.328 --> 00:00:32.478
I sometimes judge them immediately.

00:00:32.478 --> 00:00:35.030
If I hear of see somebody
supporting Hillary Clinton,

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.382
I assume they support a
liar, or someone who's

00:00:37.382 --> 00:00:39.268
hiding e-mails, or in scandals.

00:00:39.268 --> 00:00:41.109
- I definitely judge Trump supporters.

00:00:41.109 --> 00:00:46.109
- People view Trump supporters
as racists, as uneducated,

00:00:46.384 --> 00:00:48.899
as liars, and as extremists or radicals.

00:00:48.899 --> 00:00:49.944
I'm none of the above.

00:00:49.944 --> 00:00:52.136
- It's hard for me to respect
people who support him because

00:00:52.136 --> 00:00:54.402
it makes me sick the
things that he says about

00:00:54.402 --> 00:00:56.521
people of other races and genders.

00:00:56.521 --> 00:00:58.528
(playful orchestral music)

00:01:02.691 --> 00:01:04.631
- This is such an old-school hat,

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:08.206
which is probably why people
don't think she's cool.

00:01:08.206 --> 00:01:09.819
- Hillary Clinton for
president, boys and girls.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:10.724
(camera shutter)

00:01:10.724 --> 00:01:12.356
(playful orchestral music)

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:14.747
This is making me excited.

00:01:14.747 --> 00:01:16.395
- This is why people hate America.

00:01:16.395 --> 00:01:18.407
This is why other nations
don't take us seriously.

00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:19.756
- And people are gonna love this one.

00:01:19.756 --> 00:01:21.201
- I feel like if someone
sees me wearing this,

00:01:21.201 --> 00:01:22.497
they have to think it's a joke, right?

00:01:22.497 --> 00:01:23.250
(camera shutter)

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.753
(playful orchestral music)

00:01:25.665 --> 00:01:26.630
- I'm so ready to get out of here,

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:27.860
and get some people's reactions.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:30.481
- We're gonna find out the
hard way, what this is like.

00:01:30.481 --> 00:01:32.545
(playful orchestral music)

00:01:36.228 --> 00:01:37.980
So I'm wearing my Hillary hat today.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.699
- Today I'm going to the
Donald Trump golf course,

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.697
in Palos Verdes.

00:01:40.697 --> 00:01:43.285
Before I went to the Trump golf
course, I called the course

00:01:43.285 --> 00:01:45.597
to make sure that it was OK
if I wore Hillary gear there,

00:01:45.597 --> 00:01:46.675
and they advised me not to.

00:01:46.675 --> 00:01:47.961
- I feel a little bit like a fraud.

00:01:47.961 --> 00:01:49.587
- Just a minute ago I was ordering water,

00:01:49.587 --> 00:01:51.048
and the man that gave me water said,

00:01:51.048 --> 00:01:52.465
"Oh, you're a young man
voting for Hillary,"

00:01:52.465 --> 00:01:54.609
and he was like, very surprised about it.

00:01:54.609 --> 00:01:56.622
I kind of felt like I was
judged a little bit for that,

00:01:56.622 --> 00:01:57.551
for being a young man,

00:01:57.551 --> 00:01:58.920
as if I'm not supposed
to vote for Hillary.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.941
- A male co-worker came
up to me and was like,

00:02:00.941 --> 00:02:02.821
"Oh, I love Hillary,
I'm voting for her too,"

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:05.561
and it was cool to see a young person,

00:02:05.561 --> 00:02:08.371
and a young guy, be really enthusiastic.

00:02:08.371 --> 00:02:09.764
- One guy just came up
to me and asked me why

00:02:09.764 --> 00:02:12.038
I supported Hillary, I
like being asked why.

00:02:12.038 --> 00:02:14.083
- No one has said anything
negative or mean about it,

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:17.556
except actually when I first
walked in, a few people

00:02:17.556 --> 00:02:19.191
were sitting around were like, "Really?"

00:02:19.191 --> 00:02:21.327
- A couple of Bernie
supporters just yelled at me,

00:02:21.327 --> 00:02:24.427
and told me that Hillary is
all for the corporate world,

00:02:24.427 --> 00:02:26.017
and that I shouldn't
support the corporate world.

00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:27.828
- It's a little weird to wear any sort of

00:02:27.828 --> 00:02:29.747
political statement on my body.

00:02:29.747 --> 00:02:30.823
It has made me insecure.

00:02:30.823 --> 00:02:33.053
- I walked by somebody a
minute ago and they asked me

00:02:33.053 --> 00:02:35.296
if I lost a bet, because
of what I'm wearing.

00:02:35.296 --> 00:02:38.370
(energetic drums)

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.368
- The painful day has come.

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:43.664
- No. Get that off of your
f***ing head (laughs).

00:02:43.664 --> 00:02:44.825
- (Ali) You don't like it?

00:02:44.825 --> 00:02:48.215
- Ali. Ali!

00:02:48.215 --> 00:02:50.231
- Today I'm walking
around my campus at USC,

00:02:50.231 --> 00:02:51.635
and I'm already getting
all sorts of dirty looks

00:02:51.635 --> 00:02:53.239
from wearing all this Trump gear.

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.097
- Get that off! Even if
you're wearing it ironically.

00:02:56.097 --> 00:02:57.926
- Somebody just passed
by me and said, "Wow."

00:02:57.926 --> 00:02:59.878
A pair of girls just
pointed at me and laughed.

00:02:59.878 --> 00:03:01.688
One of my friends told me that he should

00:03:01.688 --> 00:03:04.430
follow me around and protect
me because of what I'm wearing.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.698
The most negative reaction I
got for wearing the Trump gear

00:03:06.698 --> 00:03:09.023
was the assistant at my
chiropractor's office.

00:03:09.023 --> 00:03:11.087
I walked in and she noticed
I was wearing the Trump gear,

00:03:11.087 --> 00:03:13.459
and she says to me, "You want
people like me deported?"

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:14.762
And I was pretty shocked, I was like,

00:03:14.762 --> 00:03:17.083
"No I don't want you deported,
you're the assistant at

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:18.731
my chiropractor, why would I want that?"

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:19.730
- I didn't realize I would have

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.185
such a visceral reaction to it.

00:03:21.185 --> 00:03:22.923
It's scarier than I thought it would be.

00:03:22.923 --> 00:03:24.815
- Here I am standing at the
Donald Trump golf course resort.

00:03:24.815 --> 00:03:27.113
A little old lady just
told me I looked very cute.

00:03:27.113 --> 00:03:28.553
Just had a lady come up and ask me to

00:03:28.553 --> 00:03:29.742
take a picture with her.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.176
- Now I'm gonna go get
ice cream with Ella.

00:03:31.176 --> 00:03:34.202
- You look... Interesting.

00:03:34.202 --> 00:03:35.801
- [Ali] Thank you.
- Why are you wearing that?

00:03:35.801 --> 00:03:37.655
- We were just going across
the street to get ice cream,

00:03:37.655 --> 00:03:39.149
like literally, across the street,

00:03:39.149 --> 00:03:40.681
and she wouldn't go with
me in a Trump shirt,

00:03:40.681 --> 00:03:42.241
she like, made me take it off.

00:03:42.241 --> 00:03:44.085
- I just went to a small Mexican joint.

00:03:44.085 --> 00:03:46.241
One of the guys was pointing at me and

00:03:46.241 --> 00:03:47.430
looking at me kind of angrily.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.613
He seemed like he didn't like me.

00:03:48.613 --> 00:03:50.786
(triumphant orchestral horns)

00:03:50.786 --> 00:03:52.399
- It made me realize that

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:55.050
the political climate right now scares me.

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:56.160
There's so much tension.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.415
- I now feel a lot warmer to other

00:03:58.415 --> 00:03:59.729
political candidate supporters.

00:03:59.729 --> 00:04:01.414
Now I've heard so much of
the rhetoric that comes from

00:04:01.414 --> 00:04:03.526
other people, which makes me
understand them a little more.

00:04:03.526 --> 00:04:04.514
- When I agreed to do this video,

00:04:04.514 --> 00:04:07.300
I had no idea the emotional
tole it would take on me,

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.204
to wear Donal Trump stuff.

00:04:09.204 --> 00:04:10.294
- When I was wearing the Hillary gear,

00:04:10.294 --> 00:04:12.523
getting some positive responses
from people made me realize,

00:04:12.523 --> 00:04:16.151
"OK, people feel warm sometimes
with Hillary, I guess."

00:04:16.151 --> 00:04:18.135
It's cool to see other
people's points of view.

00:04:18.135 --> 00:04:19.745
- I think it's cool to
care about politics because

00:04:19.745 --> 00:04:21.602
then it means that you care
about what you believe in,

00:04:21.602 --> 00:04:23.274
and you're willing to fight
for what you believe in.

00:04:23.274 --> 00:04:24.670
- All people have their reasons for

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.890
voting for a certain candidate,
and I can realize that now,

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.164
and it shouldn't be something

00:04:28.164 --> 00:04:29.664
that we chastise each other on.

00:04:29.664 --> 00:04:31.171
Instead, we should be
open to learning about

00:04:31.171 --> 00:04:33.001
other people's opinions,
and don't judge people

00:04:33.001 --> 00:04:35.325
for what they feel, just listen.

